__d(function(g,r,i,a,m,e,d){"use strict";Object.defineProperty(e,'__esModule',{value:!0}),Object.defineProperty(e,"privacy",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return n}}),Object.defineProperty(e,"terms",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return t}}),Object.defineProperty(e,"support",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return o}}),Object.defineProperty(e,"assetRegister",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return c}}),Object.defineProperty(e,"STORE_URLS",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return y}});const n={updated:'2026-10-30',sections:[{heading:{tr:'K\u0131saca',en:'In short'},body:{tr:'Hesap zorunlu de\u011fildir. Build\u2019lerin, listelerin, favorilerin ve ayarlar\u0131n bu cihazda (uygulama depolamas\u0131nda veya taray\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n yerel depolamas\u0131nda) kal\u0131r ve cihazlar aras\u0131nda e\u015fitlenmez. Giri\u015f yaparsan yaln\u0131z ad\u0131n, e-posta adresin, BattleTag\u2019in ve ba\u011flad\u0131\u011f\u0131n karakterler hesab\u0131nda saklan\u0131r. Reklam yoktur; verilerin sat\u0131lmaz.',en:'No account is required. Your builds, lists, favourites and settings stay on this device (app storage or the browser\u2019s local storage) and do not sync between devices. If you sign in, only your name, e-mail address, BattleTag and the characters you link are kept with your account. There are no ads, and your data is never sold.'}},{heading:{tr:'\u0130ste\u011fe ba\u011fl\u0131 hesap',en:'Optional account'},body:{tr:'Battle.net, Google, Apple, X veya e-posta ile giri\u015f yapabilirsin. Hesab\u0131nda g\xf6r\xfcnen ad\u0131n, e-posta adresin, varsa BattleTag\u2019in ve ba\u011flad\u0131\u011f\u0131n karakterler saklan\u0131r. Oyun parolan hi\xe7bir zaman istenmez.',en:'You can sign in with Battle.net, Google, Apple, X or e-mail. Your account keeps your display name, your e-mail address, your BattleTag if you have one, and the characters you link. Your game password is never requested.'}},{heading:{tr:'Topluluk ve Faction War',en:'Community and Faction War'},body:{tr:'Giri\u015f yapt\u0131ktan sonra yazd\u0131\u011f\u0131n konu, yan\u0131t ve grup ilanlar\u0131 ad\u0131nla birlikte herkese a\xe7\u0131k g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr. Bir gruba ba\u015fvurdu\u011fun karakterin ad\u0131n\u0131 ve sunucusunu yaln\u0131z grup lideri ve kabul edilen \xfcyeler g\xf6r\xfcr. Yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131n bildirimler (bildirilen metnin bir kopyas\u0131yla) ve engelledi\u011fin oyuncular yaln\u0131z sunucuda, ad\u0131n\u0131 i\xe7ermeyen bir hesap anahtar\u0131yla saklan\u0131r. Faction War oyu da giri\u015f ister; verdi\u011fin oy, e-posta adresinden t\xfcretilen ve ad\u0131n\u0131 i\xe7ermeyen bir anahtarla saklan\u0131r, sonu\xe7larda yaln\u0131z toplamlar g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr.',en:'Once you are signed in, the topics, replies and group listings you post are public, with your name. The name and realm of the character you apply to a group with are shown only to its leader and its accepted members. Your reports (with a copy of the reported text) and the players you block are kept on our server only, under an account key that does not contain your name. A Faction War vote also needs sign-in; it is stored under a key derived from your e-mail address that does not contain your name, and results show totals only.'}},{heading:{tr:'A\u011f, reklam ve analitik',en:'Network, ads and analytics'},body:{tr:'Reklam, reklam veya analitik SDK\u2019s\u0131 ve uygulamalar aras\u0131 takip yoktur. Sunucumuzla konu\u015fan bir \xf6zelli\u011fi kulland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda (karakter aramas\u0131, oy verme, grup ilan\u0131) sunucumuz bu olay\u0131 (t\xfcr, platform ve zaman; giri\u015f yapt\u0131ysan hesab\u0131nla) hizmetin \xe7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 i\xe7in kaydeder. Karakter aramas\u0131 Blizzard\u2019\u0131n ve Raider.IO\u2019nun herkese a\xe7\u0131k profil verisini kullan\u0131r. Oyun verisi uygulamayla gelir; baz\u0131 g\xf6rseller Blizzard\u2019\u0131n ve Wowhead\u2019in g\xf6rsel sunucular\u0131ndan y\xfcklenir. Kaynak ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131na dokundu\u011funda o site kendi gizlilik ko\u015fullar\u0131yla a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r. Web sitesini bar\u0131nd\u0131ran sunucu standart eri\u015fim kay\u0131tlar\u0131 tutabilir.',en:'There are no ads, no advertising or analytics SDKs and no tracking across apps. When you use a feature that talks to our server (a character lookup, a vote, a group listing), our server records that event (type, platform and time; with your account if you are signed in) to run the service. Character lookups use public profile data from Blizzard and Raider.IO. Game data ships with the app; some images load from Blizzard\u2019s and Wowhead\u2019s image servers. A source link opens that site under its own privacy terms. The server hosting the website may keep standard access logs.'}},{heading:{tr:'Verilerini silme',en:'Deleting your data'},body:{tr:'Ayarlar \u2192 \u201cYerel verileri sil\u201d bu cihazdaki t\xfcm kay\u0131tlar\u0131 siler. Giri\u015f yapt\u0131ysan Ayarlar \u2192 \u201cHesab\u0131 sil\u201d hesab\u0131n\u0131, olay kay\u0131tlar\u0131n\u0131, oylar\u0131n\u0131, topluluk yaz\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131, grup ilanlar\u0131n\u0131 ve ba\u015fvurular\u0131n\u0131, bildirimlerini ve engellerini sunucudan siler. Bir sorun olursa wowforeverpath@kolcu.ai adresine yaz.',en:'Settings \u2192 \u201cDelete local data\u201d removes everything on this device. If you are signed in, Settings \u2192 \u201cDelete account\u201d removes your account, its event log, your votes, your community posts, your group listings and applications, your reports and your blocks from our server. If anything goes wrong, write to wowforeverpath@kolcu.ai.'}}]},t={updated:'2026-10-30',sections:[{heading:{tr:'Resm\xee olmayan ara\xe7',en:'Unofficial tool'},body:{tr:'Bu uygulama resm\xee olmayan bir hayran arac\u0131d\u0131r; Blizzard Entertainment ile ba\u011flant\u0131l\u0131 de\u011fildir ve onun taraf\u0131ndan onaylanmam\u0131\u015ft\u0131r. World of Warcraft ve Blizzard, Blizzard Entertainment, Inc.\'in ticari markalar\u0131d\u0131r.',en:'This app is an unofficial fan tool, not affiliated with or endorsed by Blizzard Entertainment. World of Warcraft and Blizzard are trademarks of Blizzard Entertainment, Inc.'}},{heading:{tr:'Beta verisi ve do\u011fruluk',en:'Beta data and accuracy'},body:{tr:'World of Warcraft: Forever betadad\u0131r; de\u011ferler \xe7\u0131k\u0131\u015fa kadar ve sonras\u0131nda de\u011fi\u015febilir. Bilgiler patch, kaynak ve kontrol tarihiyle g\xf6sterilir; Forever i\xe7in do\u011frulanmam\u0131\u015f de\u011ferler i\u015faretlidir. Uygunluk puan\u0131 tercihlerine uygunlu\u011fu g\xf6sterir; ger\xe7ek hasar, iyile\u015ftirme veya kazanma oran\u0131 de\u011fildir. Uygulama \u201coldu\u011fu gibi\u201d sunulur.',en:'World of Warcraft: Forever is in beta and values may change before and after launch. Facts show their patch, source and check date; values not confirmed for Forever are marked. The fit score reflects your preferences; it is not real damage, healing or a win rate. The app is provided \u201cas is\u201d.'}},{heading:{tr:'Veri lisans\u0131',en:'Data license'},body:{tr:'Oyun verisinin bir k\u0131sm\u0131 warcraft.wiki.gg sayfalar\u0131ndan CC BY-SA 4.0 ile uyarlanm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r; uyarlanan veri seti de CC BY-SA 4.0 ile payla\u015f\u0131l\u0131r. Blizzard yaz\u0131lar\u0131ndan yaln\u0131z olgular \xf6zg\xfcn c\xfcmlelerle \xf6zetlenmi\u015ftir.',en:'Part of the game data is adapted from warcraft.wiki.gg pages under CC BY-SA 4.0; the adapted dataset is shared under CC BY-SA 4.0. From Blizzard posts, only facts are summarised in original wording.'}},{heading:{tr:'Topluluk kurallar\u0131',en:'Community rules'},body:{tr:'Forumda, sohbette ve grup bulucuda yazd\u0131klar\u0131n herkese a\xe7\u0131kt\u0131r. Nefret s\xf6ylemine, tacize, tehdide, cinsel i\xe7eri\u011fe, ki\u015fisel bilgileri if\u015fa etmeye, spama ve ger\xe7ek parayla alt\u0131n, boost veya hesap sat\u0131\u015f\u0131na izin verilmez; bunlara hi\xe7 tolerans g\xf6sterilmez. Her konuyu, yan\u0131t\u0131, mesaj\u0131, grubu ve ba\u015fvuran\u0131 bildirebilir, yazar\u0131n\u0131 engelleyebilirsin. Birka\xe7 oyuncunun bildirdi\u011fi i\xe7erik bir moderat\xf6r inceleyene kadar gizlenir; kurallar\u0131 \xe7i\u011fneyen i\xe7erik silinir ve bu kurallar\u0131 \xe7i\u011fneyen hesaplar toplulu\u011fa eri\u015fimini kaybedebilir. Bildirmek i\xe7in i\xe7eri\u011fin yan\u0131ndaki \u201cBildir veya engelle\u201d d\xfc\u011fmesini kullan ya da wowforeverpath@kolcu.ai adresine yaz.',en:'What you post in the forum, the chat and the group finder is public. Hate speech, harassment, threats, sexual content, sharing someone\u2019s personal information, spam and selling gold, boosts or accounts for real money are not allowed, with zero tolerance. You can report any topic, reply, message, group or applicant and block its author. Content that several players report is hidden until a moderator reviews it; content that breaks these rules is removed, and accounts that break them can lose access to the community. To report, use \u201cReport or block\u201d next to the content or write to wowforeverpath@kolcu.ai.'}}]},o={updated:'2026-10-25',sections:[{heading:{tr:'Yard\u0131m',en:'Help'},body:{tr:'\xd6nce Rehberler \u2192 \u201cYeni oyuncu sorular\u0131\u201d sayfas\u0131na bak. Bir talent \u201cdo\u011frulanmad\u0131\u201d g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcyorsa oyundaki a\xe7\u0131klamay\u0131 esas al.',en:'Start with Guides \u2192 \u201cNew player questions\u201d. If a talent shows \u201cnot verified\u201d, rely on the in-game tooltip.'}},{heading:{tr:'\u0130leti\u015fim',en:'Contact'},body:{tr:'Destek, veri d\xfczeltme bildirimleri ve geri bildirim i\xe7in e-posta: wowforeverpath@kolcu.ai (Web: https://wowforeverpath.com/support).',en:'For support, data correction reports and feedback, e-mail: wowforeverpath@kolcu.ai (Web: https://wowforeverpath.com/support).'}}]},l={tr:'\xa9 Blizzard Entertainment. Blizzard lisans\u0131 yoktur; sitenin sahibinin karar\u0131yla g\xf6sterilir.',en:'\xa9 Blizzard Entertainment. Not licensed by Blizzard; shown by the site owner\u2019s decision.'},s={tr:'Bu proje',en:'This project'},u={tr:'SIL Open Font License 1.1',en:'SIL Open Font License 1.1'},c=[{name:{tr:'Uygulama amblemi ve ikonu',en:'App emblem and icon'},source:{tr:'Bu proje i\xe7in \xf6zg\xfcn \xe7izim (SVG)',en:'Drawn originally for this project (SVG)'},license:s},{name:{tr:'Aray\xfcz ikonlar\u0131 (pusula, r\xfcn, par\u015f\xf6men vb.)',en:'UI icons (compass, runes, scroll, etc.)'},source:{tr:'Bu proje i\xe7in \xf6zg\xfcn \xe7izim (SVG)',en:'Drawn originally for this project (SVG)'},license:s},{name:{tr:'Harita kontur deseni, sis ve \u0131\u015f\u0131k efektleri',en:'Map contour pattern, fog and light effects'},source:{tr:'Bu proje i\xe7in \xf6zg\xfcn \xe7izim (SVG)',en:'Drawn originally for this project (SVG)'},license:s},{name:{tr:'S\u0131n\u0131f, talent, \u0131rk ve e\u015fya ikonlar\u0131',en:'Class, talent, race and item icons'},source:{tr:'Blizzard Entertainment \xe7izimleri. Uygulama bunlar\u0131 Blizzard\u2019\u0131n g\xf6rsel servisinden (render.worldofwarcraft.com) ve Wowhead\u2019in g\xf6rsel sunucusundan (wow.zamimg.com) y\xfckler; web sitesi bir k\u0131sm\u0131n\u0131n kopyalar\u0131n\u0131 h\u0131z i\xe7in kendi alan ad\u0131ndan sunar.',en:'Blizzard Entertainment artwork. The app loads it from Blizzard\u2019s render service (render.worldofwarcraft.com) and Wowhead\u2019s image server (wow.zamimg.com); the website serves copies of some of it from its own domain for speed.'},license:l},{name:{tr:'World of Warcraft: Forever tan\u0131t\u0131m g\xf6rselleri, zindan haritalar\u0131 ve logo',en:'World of Warcraft: Forever promotional images, dungeon maps and logo'},source:{tr:'Blizzard\u2019\u0131n Forever haber yaz\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131n kapak g\xf6rselleri ve oyunun zindan haritalar\u0131; web sitesi k\xfc\xe7\xfclt\xfclm\xfc\u015f kopyalar\u0131n\u0131 kendi alan ad\u0131ndan sunar, mobil uygulamaya kopyalanmaz.',en:'Cover images of Blizzard\u2019s Forever news posts and the game\u2019s dungeon maps; the website serves resized copies from its own domain, and they are not copied into the mobile app.'},license:l},{name:{tr:'Alegreya SC ve Alegreya Sans yaz\u0131 tipleri',en:'Alegreya SC and Alegreya Sans fonts'},source:{tr:'Huerta Tipogr\xe1fica, Google Fonts',en:'Huerta Tipogr\xe1fica, Google Fonts'},license:u},{name:{tr:'Marcellus, Marcellus SC ve Sofia Sans Semi Condensed web yaz\u0131 tipleri',en:'Marcellus, Marcellus SC and Sofia Sans Semi Condensed web fonts'},source:{tr:'Astigmatic (Marcellus) ve Sofia Sans Project Authors; Google Fonts, web sitesinde bar\u0131nd\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r (lisans metinleri /fonts alt\u0131nda)',en:'Astigmatic (Marcellus) and the Sofia Sans Project Authors; Google Fonts, hosted on the website (licence texts under /fonts)'},license:u}],y={ios:'https://apps.apple.com/app/id6827848273',android:'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=ai.kolcu.wowforeverpath'}},1093,[]);
